guide forever/class/rogue/dungeon-set-2
title Darkmantle Armor (Dungeon Set 2)
category Class
class Rogue
folder Rogue
levels 58-60
zone Ironforge
keywords Dungeon Set 2, Tier 0.5, T0.5, Darkmantle Armor, Shadowcraft Armor, Dungeon Set 1, Deliana, Mokvar, An Earnest Proposition, A Supernatural Device, Mux Manascrambler, Ectoplasmic Distiller, Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer, Just Compensation, Anthion Harmon, Dead Man's Plea, Ysida Harmon, Falrin Treeshaper, The Challenge, Theldren, Anthion's Parting Words, Bodley, Three Kings of Flame, Lord Valthalak, Brazier of Beckoning, Saving the Best for Last, Stratholme, Dire Maul, Blackrock Depths, Blackrock Spire, Scholomance
reward text Darkmantle Armor: your class's Dungeon Set 2, eight pieces, each traded for its Shadowcraft Armor piece
why The level 60 upgrade of your Shadowcraft Armor: a long chain, most of it dungeon runs for a group.

# The Dungeon Set 2 chain, Forever's copies for this class on each side (data/forever quests.json with
# forever-db/corrections): An Earnest Proposition, A Supernatural Device (8922/8923), The Ectoplasmic
# Distiller (8921), Hunting for Ectoplasm (8924), A Portable Power Source (8925), A Shifty Merchant (8928),
# Return to Deliana/Mokvar (8977/8978), Just Compensation, In Search of Anthion (8929/8930), Dead Man's Plea
# (8945), Proof of Life (8946), Anthion's Strange Request (8947), Anthion's Old Friend (8948), Falrin's
# Vendetta (8949), The Instigator's Enchantment (8950), The Challenge (9015), Anthion's Parting Words,
# Bodley's Unfortunate Fate (8960/9032), Three Kings of Flame (8961), the class group's Components of
# Importance, Left Piece, More Components of Importance and Right Piece, I See Alcaz Island In Your
# Future... (8970), Final Preparations (8994), Mea Culpa, Lord Valthalak (8995), Return to Bodley (8996),
# Back to the Beginning (8997/8998), Saving the Best for Last.
# Costs: 20 gold (An Earnest Proposition's text), 40 gold (The Ectoplasmic Distiller), the Fel Elemental
# Rod 40 gold and the Hallowed Brazier 133g 33s 33c before reputation discounts, Honored with the Argent
# Dawn to buy it (the client's item tables). Quest drops are quest-only loot, so nothing is gathered early
# but what can be bought or crafted.
# Group content: every quest whose work is a dungeon, a summoned boss or elites asks first (`when group`).

step Deliana
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip What the chain asks, so you can plan: about 30 quests from Tanaris to Blackrock Mountain. The first part is solo (Gadgetzan, the Burning Steppes, Silithus, Winterspring, the Eastern Plaguelands). Then come runs of Stratholme, Dire Maul, Blackrock Depths, Lower and Upper Blackrock Spire and Scholomance, a summoned Duke in Silithus, two bosses your class's brazier calls, Lord Valthalak, and elites in the open world: that part needs a group, and the guide asks before each quest of it. Deliana stands in the High Seat, King Magni's throne room.
  note Before you start, gather what can be bought or crafted, so you never ride back for it: a Delicate Arcanite Converter (engineers make it), 4 Greater Eternal Essence, 10 Stonescale Oil (alchemists make it), a stack of Goblin Rocket Fuel, 3 Dark Iron Bars, 20 Enchanted Leather, 3 Mooncloth, 4 Cured Rugged Hides, 4 Dark Runes, 8 Large Brilliant Shards and a Flask of Supreme Power. Gold: 20, then 40, then 40 for the Fel Elemental Rod, and about 120-133 for the Hallowed Brazier, which needs Honored with the Argent Dawn.
  note Your eight Shadowcraft Armor pieces are handed in along the way (bracers first, then belt and gloves, then boots, legs and shoulders, then helm and chest): bank spares, a hand-in takes the one in your bags. Where a hand-in offers a choice of pieces, each is cut for a different spec: take the one you play.
  accept 84152

step Mokvar
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip What the chain asks, so you can plan: about 30 quests from Tanaris to Blackrock Mountain. The first part is solo (Gadgetzan, the Burning Steppes, Silithus, Winterspring, the Eastern Plaguelands). Then come runs of Stratholme, Dire Maul, Blackrock Depths, Lower and Upper Blackrock Spire and Scholomance, a summoned Duke in Silithus, two bosses your class's brazier calls, Lord Valthalak, and elites in the open world: that part needs a group, and the guide asks before each quest of it. Mokvar stands in Grommash Hold, in the Valley of Wisdom.
  note Before you start, gather what can be bought or crafted, so you never ride back for it: a Delicate Arcanite Converter (engineers make it), 4 Greater Eternal Essence, 10 Stonescale Oil (alchemists make it), a stack of Goblin Rocket Fuel, 3 Dark Iron Bars, 20 Enchanted Leather, 3 Mooncloth, 4 Cured Rugged Hides, 4 Dark Runes, 8 Large Brilliant Shards and a Flask of Supreme Power. Gold: 20, then 40, then 40 for the Fel Elemental Rod, and about 120-133 for the Hallowed Brazier, which needs Honored with the Argent Dawn.
  note Your eight Shadowcraft Armor pieces are handed in along the way (bracers first, then belt and gloves, then boots, legs and shoulders, then helm and chest): bank spares, a hand-in takes the one in your bags. Where a hand-in offers a choice of pieces, each is cut for a different spec: take the one you play.
  accept 84159

step Winterspring Blood Samples
  only Alliance
  zone Winterspring
  tip The Frostsabers and Shardtooth bears of northern Winterspring, north of Everlook, drop the samples (level 53-60, not elite: at 58 leave the level 60 Frostsaber Stalkers, Pride Watchers and Rabid Shardtooths alone). Fly to Everlook.
  collect 21928 quest 84152.1

step Silithus Venom Samples
  only Horde
  zone Silithus
  tip The Stonelash scorpids, Sand Skitterers and Rock Stalkers of Silithus drop the samples (level 54-59, not elite). Fly to Cenarion Hold.
  collect 22381 quest 84159.1

step Deliana: A Supernatural Device
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip Bring the samples, 20 gold and your Shadowcraft Bracers: a rare drop from the mobs of Scholomance, Stratholme and Blackrock Spire, or the auction house. She gives you a Sealed Blood Container for Mux in Gadgetzan.
  collect 16710 quest 84152.2 @43.6,52.7  -- Shadowcraft Bracers
  turnin 84152
  accept 8922 npc 230319

step Mokvar: A Supernatural Device
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Bring the samples, 20 gold and your Shadowcraft Bracers: a rare drop from the mobs of Scholomance, Stratholme and Blackrock Spire, or the auction house. He gives you a Sealed Blood Container for Mux in Gadgetzan.
  collect 16710 quest 84159.2 @34.7,38.1 live  -- Shadowcraft Bracers
  turnin 84159
  accept 8923 npc 230317

step Mux Manascrambler
  zone Tanaris
  tip Mux works in the north-eastern hut of Gadgetzan, the engineers' hut. He builds the Ectoplasmic Distiller for 40 gold and the parts on your shopping list, plus 25 Volcanic Ash from the Burning Steppes.
  turnin 8922 only Alliance
  turnin 8923 only Horde
  accept 8921

step Volcanic Ash
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Click the ash piles along the lava river in the west and centre of the Burning Steppes: each gives a few. They only drop while you have the quest.
  collect 22338 quest 8921.4

step Mux Manascrambler: the Distiller
  zone Tanaris
  tip Hand in the parts and pay 40 gold: Mux pays you with Mux's Quality Goods, a bag holding 8 Goblin Rocket Fuel, and Hunting for Ectoplasm hands you the Ectoplasmic Distiller. Each placement of the distiller uses one fuel, so carry spares.
  collect 16006 quest 8921.1 @52.4,27.3 live  -- Delicate Arcanite Converter
  collect 16203 quest 8921.2 @52.4,27.3 live  -- Greater Eternal Essence
  collect 13423 quest 8921.3 @52.4,27.3 live  -- Stonescale Oil
  turnin 8921
  accept 8924

step Scorched Ectoplasm
  zone Silithus
  tip The Tortured Druids and Sentinels haunt Southwind Village in Silithus (level 55-57, not elite; silithid can join when they die). Place the Ectoplasmic Distiller among the ghosts, pull them into its glow and kill them there, standing in it yourself: ectoplasm only drops from a ghost that dies inside the glow. It lasts a few minutes, then place it again.
  collect 21937 quest 8924.1

step Frozen Ectoplasm and the Fel Elemental Rod
  zone Winterspring
  tip The Suffering and Anguished Highborne drift around Lake Kel'Theril in Winterspring (level 54-56, not elite). Place the Ectoplasmic Distiller among the ghosts, pull them into its glow and kill them there, standing in it yourself: ectoplasm only drops from a ghost that dies inside the glow. It lasts a few minutes, then place it again. While you are in Winterspring, buy the Fel Elemental Rod (40 gold) from Vi'el, an imp in the cave at the mouth of Darkwhisper Gorge in the far south: keep to the right-hand wall to slip past the elite demons in the gorge. A Shifty Merchant asks for it later, and this saves the trip back.
  collect 21936 quest 8924.2
  buy 21939 npc 16015  -- Fel Elemental Rod

step Stable Ectoplasm
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip The ghosts and banshees of the Eastern Plaguelands (Unseen Servants, Eyeless Watchers, Death Singers, Hate Shriekers; level 55-59, not elite) drop it; Northdale in the north-east is a good spot. The shriekers fear: fight close to the distiller. Place the Ectoplasmic Distiller among the ghosts, pull them into its glow and kill them there, standing in it yourself: ectoplasm only drops from a ghost that dies inside the glow. It lasts a few minutes, then place it again.
  collect 21935 quest 8924.3

step Mux Manascrambler: Magma Lord Bokk
  zone Tanaris
  tip Bring the distiller back with the ectoplasm: it is handed in too.
  turnin 8924
  accept 8925

step Magma Lord Bokk
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Magma Lord Bokk (level 58-60, not elite) stands in a lava pool in the south-west of the Burning Steppes. His earth shock hits for about 600 and knocks you back; pull him away from the lava. Careful: elite dragonkin patrol nearby.
  kill 16043
  collect 21938 quest 8925.1

step Mux Manascrambler: the Ghost Revealer
  zone Tanaris
  tip Mux takes the Magma Core, then asks for the Fel Elemental Rod you already have, and gives you the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer. Keep the Revealer to the end: it is the only way to see Anthion and Bodley.
  turnin 8925
  accept 8928
  turnin 8928
  accept 8977 only Alliance
  accept 8978 only Horde

step Deliana: Just Compensation
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip Just Compensation takes your Shadowcraft Belt: a rare drop from the mobs of Blackrock Spire, or the auction house, and your Shadowcraft Gloves: Shadow Hunter Vosh'gajin in Lower Blackrock Spire (about 18%), or the auction house.
  turnin 8977 npc 230319
  accept 84168
