  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Just Compensation takes your Shadowcraft Belt: a rare drop from the mobs of Blackrock Spire, or the auction house, and your Shadowcraft Gloves: Shadow Hunter Vosh'gajin in Lower Blackrock Spire (about 18%), or the auction house.
  turnin 8978 npc 230317
