step Bodley
  when group 9015
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Bodley's ghost stands on the ledge before the Blackrock Spire portal, high inside Blackrock Mountain: use the Ghost Revealer there. Three Kings of Flame wants the Incendicite of Incendius (Lord Incendius in Blackrock Depths), the Ember of Emberseer (Pyroguard Emberseer in Upper Blackrock Spire), the Cinder of Cynders (the Duke of Cynders in Silithus) and a Hallowed Brazier from the Argent Dawn.
  turnin 8960 only Alliance
  turnin 9032 only Horde

step Three Kings of Flame
  when group 8961
  zone Burning Steppes
  accept 8961

step Honored with the Argent Dawn
  when onquest 8961
  when !rep "Argent Dawn" Honored
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip The Hallowed Brazier is sold only to Honored. Take the Argent Dawn Commission (Argent Officer Pureheart at Chillwind Camp, Argent Officer Garush at the Bulwark, or Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff at Light's Hope Chapel) and wear it: Scourgestones then drop from the Scourge, and the Argent officers take them back for reputation. Every Scourge kill in the Plaguelands counts, Stratholme's and Scholomance's undead give 5 each up to Honored, and Light's Hope Chapel's dungeon quests give 100-200 each. Polestar's Argent Dawn Reputation guide (Reputation) walks it step by step.
  rep 529 Honored

step Hallowed Brazier
  when onquest 8961
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip The Argent Dawn quartermasters (Light's Hope Chapel, Chillwind Camp, the Bulwark) sell it: 133 gold 33 silver, less with your reputation discount.
  buy 22014 nearest

step Blackrock Depths and Upper Blackrock Spire
  when group 8961
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Lord Incendius guards the Black Anvil in Blackrock Depths (a group of five). Pyroguard Emberseer is the first boss of Upper Blackrock Spire, a group of up to ten. Each player with the quest loots their own.
  kill 9017 @34.8,85.3 live group 5  -- Lord Incendius, Blackrock Depths
  collect 21987 quest 8961.1 @34.8,85.3 live
  kill 9816 @34.8,85.3 live group 10  -- Pyroguard Emberseer, Upper Blackrock Spire
  collect 21988 quest 8961.2 @34.8,85.3 live

step The Duke of Cynders
  when group 8961
  zone Silithus
  tip The Duke (level 62 elite, bring a group of five) only comes when someone summons him at one of the Twilight's Greater Wind Stones in Silithus: the summoner wears the full Twilight Cultist set (Cowl, Mantle and Robe, from the Twilight cultists of the Silithus camps), carries a Twilight Cultist Medallion of Station (Aurel Goldleaf at Cenarion Hold: three Abyssal Crests from summoned Templars and a Large Brilliant Shard) and a Signet of Beckoning: Fire, which calls the Duke of Cynders rather than a random Duke. Joining someone else's summon is the quick way: every player with the quest loots their own Cinder.
  kill 15206 group 5  -- The Duke of Cynders
  collect 21989 quest 8961.3

step Bodley: Components of Importance
  when group 8961
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Bodley's next task depends on your class: the piece the summoning brazier needs.
  collect 22014 quest 8961.4 @32.2,25.8  -- Hallowed Brazier
  turnin 8961

step Components of Importance
  when group 8964
  zone Burning Steppes
  accept 8964

step Components of Importance: Brilliant Sword of Zealotry
  when group 8964
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip At Tyr's Hand, the Scarlet town in the south-east of the Eastern Plaguelands, the Scarlet Praetorians (level 56-57 elites) of its upper courtyard drop the Brilliant Sword of Zealotry (a rare drop: up to about 50 kills). They are elites: bring a friend or two unless your gear is good. It drops only while you have the quest; everyone in the group with it can loot one.
  collect 22228 quest 8964.1 group 3  -- Brilliant Sword of Zealotry

step Bodley: The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet
  when group 8964
  zone Burning Steppes
  turnin 8964

step The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet
  when group 8968
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Bodley gives you a Brazier of Beckoning.
  accept 8968

step The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet: Jarien and Sothos
  when group 8968
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip A dungeon run for a group of five. Bodley's Brazier of Beckoning calls Jarien and Sothos to Balnazzar's chamber at the end of Stratholme's Scarlet side, through the main gate: clear to it first. Use the brazier there, kill Jarien and Sothos and loot the piece. Both are elites: Jarien cleaves, so tank him facing away; Sothos fears. When one falls the other's spirit fights on. Keep the brazier: Bodley wants it back with the piece.
  use 22051 @26.5,10.4 live group 5  -- Brazier of Beckoning: summons Jarien and Sothos
  kill 16101 quest 8968.1 @26.5,10.4 live group 5  -- Jarien
  kill 16102 quest 8968.2 @26.5,10.4 live group 5  -- Sothos
  collect 21984 quest 8968.3 @26.5,10.4 live  -- Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet

