  when group 8968
  zone Burning Steppes
  turnin 8968

step I See Alcaz Island In Your Future...
  when group 8970
  zone Burning Steppes
  accept 8970

step Bloodkelp
  when group 8970
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip The Strashaz naga of Alcaz Island, off the north-east coast of Dustwallow Marsh, carry it (level 59-61 elites, and Tidelord Rrurgaz at 62): bring a friend or two. The Baskets of Bloodkelp on the island give 1 to 3 each without a fight. Swim over from the coast north of Theramore; elite hydras roam the water.
  collect 22094 quest 8970.1 group 3

step Bodley: More Components of Importance
  when group 8970
  zone Burning Steppes
  turnin 8970

step More Components of Importance
  when group 8985
  zone Burning Steppes
  accept 8985

step More Components of Importance: Starbreeze Village Relic
  when group 8985
  zone Winterspring
  tip At the Frostmaul giants' gorge in southern Winterspring, south of Everlook, Frostmaul Giants and Frostmaul Preservers (level 59-60 elites) drop the Starbreeze Village Relic (a rare drop: it can take dozens of kills). They are elites: bring a friend or two unless your gear is good. It drops only while you have the quest; everyone in the group with it can loot one.
  collect 22227 quest 8985.1 group 3  -- Starbreeze Village Relic

step Bodley: The Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet
  when group 8985
  zone Burning Steppes
  turnin 8985

step The Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet
  when group 8990
  zone Burning Steppes
  accept 8990

step The Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet: Isalien
  when group 8990
  when group 8970
  zone Feralas
  tip A dungeon run for a group of five. Bodley's Brazier of Beckoning calls Isalien to the shrine by Alzzin the Wildshaper at the end of Dire Maul East: clear the area first. Use the brazier there, kill Isalien and loot the piece. She is an elite priestess spirit with a hippogryph at her side and strong heals: interrupt her or drain her mana. Keep the brazier: Bodley wants it back with the piece. Then use the Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (Bodley gave it back to you) to join the pieces into Lord Valthalak's Amulet.
  use 22050 @59.2,45.1 live group 5  -- Brazier of Beckoning: summons Isalien
  kill 16097 quest 8990.1 @59.2,45.1 live group 5  -- Isalien
  collect 22046 @59.2,45.1 live group 5  -- Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet
  use 21984 quest 8990.2 @59.2,45.1 live  -- Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet: joins the pieces
  collect 22048 quest 8990.2 @59.2,45.1 live  -- Lord Valthalak's Amulet

step Bodley: Final Preparations
  when group 8990
  zone Burning Steppes
  turnin 8990

step Final Preparations
  when group 8994
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip 40 Blackrock Bracers from the Blackrock orcs of Blackrock Spire (the Scarshield Grunts in the mountain's halls outside the portal, level 53-54 elites, drop them most often; Upper Blackrock Spire's orcs better than Lower's), only while you have the quest, and a Flask of Supreme Power (alchemists make it at an alchemy lab; or the auction house).
  accept 8994
  collect 22138 quest 8994.1 group 3
  collect 13512 quest 8994.2 @32.2,25.8  -- Flask of Supreme Power
  turnin 8994

step Mea Culpa, Lord Valthalak
  when group 8995
  zone Burning Steppes
  accept 8995

step Upper Blackrock Spire: Lord Valthalak
  when group 8995
  when group 8994
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip A raid of up to ten in Upper Blackrock Spire. Clear to The Beast's room and kill The Beast, then use the Brazier of Beckoning there to call Lord Valthalak (level 63 boss). Kill his shades quickly; in his last phase he hits the whole room hard. Use Lord Valthalak's Amulet on his corpse: his spirit appears. Give him the amulet, then take Return to Bodley from him.
  use 22056 @34.8,85.3 live group 10  -- Brazier of Beckoning, in The Beast's room
  kill 16042 quest 8995.1 @34.8,85.3 live group 10  -- Lord Valthalak
